The shared pieces every AMIX Installer kernel relink uses: patch_io_init.py
(it points AMIX's boot table io_init at the installer's amixdrv_init, which
calls parinit and then each chosen driver's init), check_relink_relocs.py
(the loader's relocation check on the result) and the amixdrv_init stub
template, in /usr/share/amix-installer/kit-tools.
